WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.923
Do not assume every view is writable A simple
one-table view may support

00:00:05.936 --> 00:00:11.750
automatic updates A join or aggregate view does not
have the same direct

00:00:11.776 --> 00:00:17.692
row mapping Materialized views are stored query
results not ordinary

00:00:17.718 --> 00:00:23.716
write-through interfaces Always check the actual
PostgreSQL behavior

00:00:23.743 --> 00:00:25.716
for the view definition you are designing
